WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.078
"I must go to the shop today," Dora said.

2
00:00:24.079 --> 00:00:28.142
"Ugh." Her five ducklings groaned.

3
00:00:28.143 --> 00:00:32.751
"The shop is boring," the biggest duckling said.

4
00:00:32.752 --> 00:00:41.017
"Can we stay here?"

5
00:00:41.018 --> 00:00:45.063
"I will watch your ducklings," Jemima said.

6
00:00:45.064 --> 00:00:48.157
"I can take care of six babies."

7
00:00:48.158 --> 00:00:51.231
"Hmm . . . ," Dora said.

8
00:00:51.232 --> 00:00:53.811
"Are you sure?"

9
00:00:53.812 --> 00:01:04.368
"Yes!" Jemima snapped. "I am sure."

10
00:01:04.369 --> 00:01:19.439
"Thank you," Dora said. "I will be back soon."

11
00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:41.941
Jemima led all the ducklings around the farm.

12
00:01:41.942 --> 00:01:45.400
Her baby followed her.

13
00:01:45.401 --> 00:01:47.699
But the other ducklings stopped.

14
00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:49.151
"Me first!"

15
00:01:49.152 --> 00:01:51.556
"You were first last time!"

16
00:01:51.557 --> 00:02:07.493
"My turn!"

17
00:02:07.494 --> 00:02:10.951
"No fighting!" Jemima said.

18
00:02:10.952 --> 00:02:14.477
"Come along."

19
00:02:14.478 --> 00:02:36.599
Dora's ducklings ran after Jemima.

20
00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:39.806
"This is easy," Jemima said.

21
00:02:39.807 --> 00:02:44.862
Suddenly it seemed very quiet.

22
00:02:44.863 --> 00:02:48.085
"Uh-oh," Jemima said.

23
00:02:48.086 --> 00:02:50.675
She looked back.

24
00:02:50.676 --> 00:02:55.855
Dora's ducklings were gone!

